  * Update README for current features and packaging
  * Align crosswind chart and recording time with ICAO Annex 16
  * Updated copyright year.
  * Modernize Debian packaging
  * Round mean wind direction instead of truncating
  * Add legend for the humidity/temperature limit windows
  * Color wind values to match the compass pointers
  * Update dependencies and simplify lint setup
